          "reviewed_at": "2026-10-14",
          "reviewer": "Cam",
          "notes": "The APH-derived case record gives only the unqualified name John Paul College. The local pinned institution register contains several distinct schools with this exact name (including Frankston VIC, Daisy Hill QLD, and Kalgoorlie WA) and a similarly named St John Paul College in Coffs Harbour NSW. Official Victorian and Queensland sources confirm distinct institutions; no person-specific source located in the allowed search budget identifies which one Jessica Collins attended. A school-wide mapping would therefore be unsafe. Leave the school policy at ambiguous_name and resolve this member assertion separately when individual evidence is available. The Sol retry researched only education:297964:0477b661fc755dd3. Two queries and four source opens, including one failed official-page fetch, supplied no campus-specific attendance evidence. The scoped assertion remains unresolved, and the ambiguous-name school policy remains necessary.",
